                                      number frozen at 3) to every client,
                                      but a modern client reads putSummary()
                                      's layout, so every field past the
                                      third is shifted and misread. The
                                      capture also shows the resulting
                                      symptom on the wire: the client sends
                                      an extra post-error marker at [0018],
                                      unanswered in the real-server capture,
                                      which sendMarkerCancelError() answers
                                      at [0019]-[0020] - a marker/response
                                      pair that exists only because of the
                                      misparse (#10039)
